{
  "name": "NIAS_L22_Full_1262Shots_2D_Marine",
  "description": "Full 31.6 km offshore NIAS 2D marine line (all 1,262 SEG-D shots = 121,152 live traces): SEG-D -> 4s -> Debias -> Marine Geom -> Bandpass -> TAR -> Predictive Decon -> F-K Filter -> CDP Sort -> 8-location IVA Semblance Auto-Pick -> NMO -> CDP Stack -> AGC -> Post-Stack 2D Kirchhoff Time Migration -> SEG-Y Export",
  "steps": [
